platformOS is in the process of obtaining **ISO 27001** and **SOC 2 Type II** certification.

* **ISO 27001** is an internationally recognized standard for establishing, operating and continually improving an information security management system.
* **SOC 2 Type II** is an independent audit that evaluates whether security controls are designed appropriately and operate effectively over a period of time.

Channel Partners and clients who plan to obtain SOC 2 or ISO 27001 certification for their own products built on platformOS can rely on the platformOS controls for the hosting and infrastructure layer. Contact the platformOS team to coordinate your certification.

For technical details on hosting, data protection, backups and disaster recovery, see [Security and Disaster Recovery](/developer-guide/about-platformos/security-drp).

{%- capture content -%}To learn more about our security and compliance program and supporting documentation, visit the <a href="https://trust.platformos.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">platformOS Trust Center</a>.{%- endcapture -%}
